1
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,576
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,821 --> 00:00:12,688
=Episode 13=

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:15,603
(Someone hides deeper than I do.)

4
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:17,680
Let go of me!

5
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:18,560
Let go!

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,800
Let go!

7
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:21,960
Mother.

8
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,120
Help me!

9
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,200
Noble Consort Hui.

10
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:29,760
You have falsified the royal bloodline!

11
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,440
And defiled the harem!

12
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,240
You wretch!

13
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,880
Have I not treated you well?

14
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,280
How could you do such a thing?

15
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,480
You...

16
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,640
Your Highness.

17
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,720
Escort the Empress Dowager back.

18
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,760
Yes.

19
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:46,720
Be careful.

20
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,440
Send the second prince as well.

21
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:51,960
Yes.

22
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,480
My son...

23
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,240
My son!

24
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,000
Mother!

25
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,720
My son!

26
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:56,160
Let go!

27
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,000
Mother...

28
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:58,440
Let go.

29
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,080
Your Majesty!

30
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,080
Spare my life.

31
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:01,760
It's all my fault.

32
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,640
I confess.

33
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:03,920
On the night of the spring equinox,

34
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,960
I learned the eldest prince
was secretly named heir.

35
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,560
I was blinded by ambition.

36
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,080
So I plotted against him,

37
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:10,760
hoping to make my son the crown prince.

38
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,240
It was all my fault.

39
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,920
Please spare my child!

40
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,800
Please spare my child!

41
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,320
Brother.

42
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,800
The child is innocent.

43
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,400
Sentence me to death,

44
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,000
but spare the child.

45
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,920
Your Majesty.

46
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,480
My Lingxi...

47
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,680
Died on that very night.

48
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,000
That night,

49
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,880
I took Lingxi

50
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,200
to the Imperial Garden

51
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,400
to release a sky lantern.

52
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,080
But by chance,

53
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:39,560
two palace maids bumped into her.

54
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,440
The longevity lock you gave her

55
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,240
went missing.

56
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,760
I...

57
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,280
I went to look for the lock.

58
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,600
And Lingxi disappeared.

59
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:50,240
Later, she fell from the rockery
and died.

60
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,480
Your Majesty.

61
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,840
Doesn't it seem

62
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:55,120
there's something amiss?

63
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,840
Noble Consort Hui.

64
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:02,040
This is your last chance.

65
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,680
Confess all your crimes truthfully,

66
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,800
and I'll spare the second prince.

67
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,440
You'll have a dignified death.

68
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,000
Lingxi's death...

69
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,600
That was my doing too.

70
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:24,680
That night, Prince Su and I
met by the rockery.

71
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,760
Lingxi happened to see us.

72
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:28,680
So I

73
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,360
ordered Zhaoyi Shen

74
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,640
to kill Lingxi

75
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,280
and stage it as an accidental fall.

76
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:37,040
I thought

77
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:38,360
a mute child born to a Cairen

78
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,480
was of no consequence.

79
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,040
But Fu Rong

80
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,840
kept hounding me..

81
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,200
Your Majesty.

82
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,400
I've confessed all.

83
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,520
Please spare my child.

84
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,480
You held the rank of Noble Consort,

85
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,680
and the Empress Dowager's favor.

86
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,120
You hold such noble status,

87
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,720
yet you are so cruel and vicious!

88
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,360
You defiled the harem,

89
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,600
and tainted the royal bloodline.

90
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,080
You tried to kill my princess

91
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,160
and plot against my heir!

92
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,400
By my decree.

93
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:08,840
Banish the second prince
from the palace,

94
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,280
never to return!

95
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,680
Prince Su.

96
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,240
You defied all moral order,

97
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,560
defiled the harem,

98
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:15,880
and dared to plot

99
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,800
against the royal heirs.

100
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,160
Death by a thousand cuts!

101
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,840
Noble Consort Hui.

102
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,040
You defiled the harem,

103
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,000
and deceived the sovereign.

104
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,200
You tainted the royal bloodline,

105
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,120
killed a princess,

106
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,360
and framed my heir.

107
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,440
From this day forth,

108
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,800
your title is revoked.

109
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,960
Send her to the cold palace

110
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,280
and grant her poisoned wine
to die in atonement.

111
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,080
Prince.

112
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,800
Sorry.

113
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,480
Huilan.

114
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,120
Take them away!

115
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:45,320
Prince!

116
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,520
Huilan!

117
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,200
Huilan...

118
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,720
Zhaoyi Rong has lost
her beloved daughter

119
00:04:58,960 --> 00:04:59,880
and suffered an injustice.

120
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,920
She has protected my heirs.

121
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,560
From this day forth,

122
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,360
she's promoted to Consort.

123
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,320
Henceforth, Jinxuan

124
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:08,520
is yours to care for.

125
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,560
Thank you, Your Majesty.

126
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,120
I will treat her

127
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,840
as my own child,

128
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,160
and care for her well.

129
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,560
I won't fail Your Majesty.

130
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,520
It's you.

131
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:27,520
Who else could it be?

132
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,920
It's all because of you

133
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,480
that I've come to this.

134
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:35,560
You set a beauty trap,

135
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,960
to catch the eldest prince.

136
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:38,600
But you were caught instead.

137
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,600
How does that feel?

138
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,400
You wretch!

139
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,080
Even after entering the palace,

140
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,600
you still yearned for Prince Su.

141
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,920
You had his child in secret.

142
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,400
And you even tried to hide the truth,

143
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,280
putting your illegitimate son

144
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,560
on the throne.

145
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,040
I must say,

146
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:59,640
I admire your audacity.

147
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,000
Was that fair

148
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,680
to the eldest prince?

149
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:07,200
Man proposes,

150
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:08,280
heaven disposes.

151
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,480
There's no fairness in this harem.

152
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,280
The victor takes all.

153
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,280
I lost,

154
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:15,920
and I accept it.

155
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,000
But one thing puzzles me.

156
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,440
After all my careful planning,

157
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,040
why would they all

158
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,280
listen to a powerless Zhaoyi like you?

159
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,840
Concubine Rou,

160
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,320
the eldest prince,

161
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,280
and the physician...

162
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,280
You put them up to it, didn't you?

163
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,600
Yes.

164
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:34,360
They were all part of my plan.

165
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,640
You're a mother yourself.

166
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,520
The moment you killed Lingxi,

167
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,640
you should have known

168
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,840
a mother seeking revenge for her child

169
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,560
would stop at nothing!

170
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,720
What a pity.

171
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,600
She was mute.

172
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,880
That's why she died.

173
00:07:58,440 --> 00:08:00,080
If she'd been blind

174
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,600
and deaf,

175
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,400
she wouldn't have seen
what she shouldn't,

176
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,680
or heard what she shouldn't.

177
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,560
You wretch!

178
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:13,280
You're still unrepentant
at death's door!

179
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:16,000
It's all that fool, Zhaoyi Shen,

180
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,520
lost the pearls.

181
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:20,120
Or none of this would've happened.

182
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,640
Zhaoyi Shen was a fool,

183
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:25,400
but you're the biggest fool of all.

184
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,560
You naively thought Concubine Rou

185
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,760
would give up her own life

186
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,960
just to serve your ends.

187
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:44,000
Tonight...

188
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,720
You'll make your move, right?

189
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,080
Mind your own business.

190
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,240
Concubine Rou.

191
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,600
The eldest prince is the heir.

192
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,280
Do you really think

193
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:03,440
he's as simple as he seems?

194
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:04,920
Your beauty trap...

195
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:07,000
Do you think he'll fall for it?

196
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,200
That day at Zhongning Palace,

197
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,600
you pretended to be a Go master.

198
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,840
He nearly believed you at first.

199
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:17,360
But did you know

200
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,520
you had a fatal flaw?

201
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,280
When you played,

202
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:23,200
you didn't even know the basic atari.

203
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:25,840
That gave you away.

204
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,280
You'd only memorized the manual.

205
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,760
You don't know how to play.

206
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,880
Even I saw through you.

207
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,200
What makes you think

208
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,360
the eldest prince didn't?

209
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,240
The eldest prince

210
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,480
surely

211
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,080
suspects you by now.

212
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,040
He won't let his guard down.

213
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:44,760
If you keep down this path,

214
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,360
you'll be the first

215
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,640
to die.

216
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,560
There's only one way out for you.

217
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:53,720
Listen to me.

218
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:55,040
I'm the only one

219
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,760
who can save you.

220
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,120
I've arranged everything for you.

221
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:13,360
Tonight, we'll join forces.

222
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,640
Noble Consort Hui

223
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:15,880
is as good as dead.

224
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:27,920
I told you,

225
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,680
I'd fight you to the death.

226
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:32,440
You think I feared my mother?

227
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:36,160
I was only pretending for your sake.

228
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:38,280
Otherwise, how could you

229
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:40,320
have gone ahead with

230
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,640
your plans so boldly?

231
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,760
You had Concubine Rou lure

232
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,120
the eldest prince with Go.

233
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:48,040
But he had already
seen through her tricks.

234
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,640
The three of us joined forces.

235
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,880
We used Yaoqin, the palace maid

236
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,480
who sought revenge for her mistress,

237
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,680
to put on a little show.

238
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,280
You and Prince Su

239
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:58,560
fell for it completely.

240
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,560
I also arranged for Princess Jinxuan

241
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:04,960
to cross paths with His Majesty,

242
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:07,000
leading him to Chengxi Palace.

243
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,640
That's how he caught you two

244
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,360
in the act.

245
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:13,120
You wretches!

246
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,160
You all deserve to die!

247
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:17,800
No one in this harem

248
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:20,280
gets to stand aside.

249
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,880
If I die,

250
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:24,040
you'll be the next!

251
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:26,080
You'll all die with me!

252
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,560
I didn't come here today

253
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,280
to hear you bark like a dog.

254
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,280
Answer me.

255
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:32,960
Did you poison my Lingxi

256
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,520
and make her mute?

257
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:36,760
Speak!

258
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,400
I found Lingxi's

259
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,040
medical records when she was born.

260
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,480
She wasn't born mute.

261
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,080
Her muteness

262
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,120
must have been caused by someone.

263
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:47,080
Tell me!

264
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,320
Was that

265
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,600
you?

266
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,560
So there's more to this story.

267
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,720
This harem is full of hidden talents.

268
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:58,240
Someone

269
00:11:58,640 --> 00:12:00,640
hides deeper than I do.

270
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,680
If it wasn't you,

271
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:12,480
then I'll

272
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,600
leave you with an intact corpse.

273
00:12:30,210 --> 00:12:31,663
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

274
00:12:37,696 --> 00:12:38,776
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

275
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:39,600
Lingxi...

276
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:43,040
I've brought

277
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:46,920
the one who killed you to justice.

278
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,440
Soon,

279
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,000
I'll send her to join you,

280
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,520
so she can beg forgiveness

281
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:57,480
for what she did to you.

282
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,280
I will find

283
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,280
the one who poisoned you

284
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,480
and took your voice.

285
00:13:05,936 --> 00:13:07,443
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

286
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,160
Rest easy, my child.

287
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:14,440
Everyone who hurt you

288
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:18,840
will pay for it.

289
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,040
Guards.

290
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,480
Bring in the poisoned wine.

291
00:14:21,143 --> 00:14:22,383
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

292
00:14:33,043 --> 00:14:35,836
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

293
00:14:44,503 --> 00:14:45,829
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

294
00:14:58,760 --> 00:14:59,920
Let's go.

295
00:15:36,580 --> 00:15:41,060
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

296
00:15:41,500 --> 00:15:46,100
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

297
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:50,900
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

298
00:15:51,140 --> 00:15:55,740
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

299
00:15:56,020 --> 00:16:00,500
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

300
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:05,540
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

301
00:16:05,740 --> 00:16:10,340
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

302
00:16:10,700 --> 00:16:15,300
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

303
00:16:15,460 --> 00:16:20,060
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

304
00:16:20,340 --> 00:16:23,620
♪Let the stars and sea♪

